<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2409_9263.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Edler</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eerenvest</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromm</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fuersichtiger</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>, Herr Burgermeister, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gunstiger</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrender</unclear>, lieb-
<lb n="3"/>er Herr, denen seyen myn guotwillige dienst und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, sampt
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurbigg</unclear> ehren, liebs und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwuerscht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allzyt</unclear> zuvor. By <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mir</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>ist erschinen myn lieber Amptsangehoeriger, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Marthj</unclear> Schuff-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">elbeger</unclear></persName> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fischental</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hof</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wald</unclear></placeName>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nebent</unclear> anderem
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">klagende</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuergebracht</unclear>. Als dann er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nammen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueders</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schuffelbergers</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">B</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aaerg</unclear> zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fischental</unclear></placeName>, zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">S. Gallen</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> der Herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weßen</unclear>, und daselbst mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> Burger, <persName resp="#ner">Othmar Appenzeller</persName>,
<lb n="11"/>dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Metzger</unclear>, sampt den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verordneten</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benamsten</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaelbfehl</unclear>, nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> des alhie zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-413" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Grueningen</placeName> ergangenen
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urtheils</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besichtigenn</unclear> helffen wellen etc. Da <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">were</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Im</unclear> neb-
<lb n="14"/>ent anderen mehr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegneten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schmerzlichkeiten</unclear> (derer
<lb n="15"/>sich im wenigisten nit versehen) fuergehalten worden,
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">es</unclear> habe myn Amptsangehoeriger, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hejnj</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deeler</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lehen</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halter</unclear>, by wald, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear> Burger, <persName resp="#ner">Jacoben Appen-
<lb n="18"/>zeller</persName>, den Metzger, wegen einer schuld, daselbst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> Hof
<lb n="19"/>wald, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verarestieren</unclear> lassen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Troester</unclear> zum rechten stellen muessen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wellichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethott</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deeler</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erloubt</unclear> haben solte, und sich die Herren
<lb n="22"/>darab <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mechtig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwaerdt</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnen</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewußt</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>, was die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoessischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bruch</unclear> und
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uswyßend</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welliches</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eruolget</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> deßwegen ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">arrest</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nomen</unclear> worden, und an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anloben</unclear> muessen, sich
<lb n="27"/>uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestimpten</unclear> tag, widerumb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daselbst</unclear> zum rechten
<lb n="28"/>zestellen etc. Mit wellichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worten</unclear> aber mir unguettlich,
<lb n="29"/>gwalt und unrecht beschehen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> sich mit keiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">war</unclear>-
<lb n="30"/>heit nit befinden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear>, das ich Jme Deeler soellichs
<lb n="31"/>erloubt habe, deßwegen ich dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jme</unclear>, umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelliches</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2409_9264.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fräfel</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falsch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgeben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innamen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">myner</unclear> gnedigen
<lb n="33"/>Herren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberen</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdienen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">buessen</unclear> und
<lb n="34"/>straaffen wird, bit derhalb die Herren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orts</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">für</unclear> entschuldiget zehalten, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">myne</unclear> ampts angehörigen
<lb n="36"/>(als die sich dessen nichts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermügend</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entzit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entgelten</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>zelassen, sonder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jederzyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">günstigen</unclear> willen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueer</unclear>-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kennen</unclear>, wie wir inen das gegentheil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> gesinnet sind,
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diewyl</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermerter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuffelberger</unclear></persName>, wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölichen</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unwarhafften</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgebens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unschuldigerwyß</unclear> inn arrest
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genommen</unclear> worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> der pfliht des deßwegen (wie
<lb n="42"/>gemelt) thonen wunsches widererlassen und ledig sagen,
<lb n="43"/>und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jehnigen</unclear> so etwas an inen zesprechen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewünnen</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kostens</unclear> wegen alherwysen, soll <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jedem</unclear> (wie
<lb n="45"/>billich) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> unnd gebürlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> und recht gehalten werden,
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> das sich niemants <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechtmessiger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerklagen</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>haben wirt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. Das hab den Herren ich zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">myner</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notwendigen</unclear> entschuldigung, wie ouch zuo rettung
<lb n="49"/>mynes verthruwten ampts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogethanen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besten</unclear> nit
<lb n="50"/>verhalten können, dieselben hiemit sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allne</unclear> dem
<lb n="51"/>schirm <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">göttlicher</unclear> gnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelhende</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>. den <origDate when="1623-12-23" resp="#ner">23 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dec</unclear>-
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ember</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ao</unclear>. 1623</origDate>.
<lb n="53"/>Der Herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allzyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ganntz</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>dienst: unnd guotwilliger
<lb n="55"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Hanns Caspar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Heidegger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vogt</unclear> der
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Herrschafft</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-413" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grüningen</unclear></placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2409_9265.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="57"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fursichtigen</unclear> und wysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgermeister</unclear>
<lb n="58"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rat</unclear> der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Santgallen</unclear></orgName> unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besundern</unclear>
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frunden</unclear> und getruwen lieben eidgnossen.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2409_9266.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="60"/>Den edlen, ehrnuesten, frommen, fuersichtigen,
<lb n="61"/>ersamen unnd wisen herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister
<lb n="62"/>unnd Rath der Statt St. Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meynen</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstigen</unclear>, ehrenden lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>.
</p>
